---
---

<section class="prompt-runs-section" id="prompt-execution">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="runs-header">
      <div class="badge">
        <span class="badge-dot" style="background:#10b981;box-shadow:0 0 8px #10b981;" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        new feature &middot; prompt execution
      </div>
      <p class="section-eyebrow">// execute templates instantly</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Don't Just Render. Run Prompts.</h2>
      <p class="runs-desc-left">
        px0 now supports native prompt execution, allowing you to invoke prompts directly. px0 handles template interpolation, retrieves versioned parameters, routes requests to upstream LLMs, and standardizes streaming under a single unified protocol.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="runs-features-grid">
      <div class="runs-feature-card">
        <div class="runs-feature-title">
          <span class="runs-feature-icon">✦</span> Multi-Provider Routing
        </div>
        <p class="runs-feature-desc">
          Swap models (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, DeepSeek, Groq, OpenRouter) with unified naming prefixes (e.g., <code>anthropic/claude-3</code>) without updating application code.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="runs-feature-card">
        <div class="runs-feature-title">
          <span class="runs-feature-icon">✦</span> Unified SSE Streaming
        </div>
        <p class="runs-feature-desc">
          A single streaming parser format for your frontend. No more managing provider-specific stream chunk formats or parsing logic.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="runs-feature-card">
        <div class="runs-feature-title">
          <span class="runs-feature-icon">✦</span> Ad-Hoc In-Flight Overrides
        </div>
        <p class="runs-feature-desc">
          Prototype instantly. Override active models, temperatures, and key variables on-the-fly directly within individual execution requests.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .runs-header {
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 0 56px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .runs-header .badge {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .runs-desc-left {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--txt-muted);
    margin-top: 16px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .runs-features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .runs-feature-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    padding: 32px 28px;
    transition: border-color 0.3s, background-color 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .runs-feature-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--bdr-hi);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .runs-feature-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--txt);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .runs-feature-icon {
    color: var(--yellow);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .runs-feature-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--txt-muted);
  }

  .runs-feature-desc code {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    background: var(--code-bg);
    padding: 2px 4px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    color: var(--yellow);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .runs-features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .runs-features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
